BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:allin2026-day1@colincalnan.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260917
SUMMARY:ALL IN 2026, Day 1
LOCATION:Palais des congrès de Montréal, 1001 Place Jean-Paul-Riopelle, Montréal, QC H2Z 1H5
DESCRIPTION:Canada's largest AI conference. Five tracks: AI & Society; Applied AI & Enterprise Transformation; AI at the Frontier; AI, Data & Infrastructure; Physical AI & Robotics. Eleven industry verticals including Media & Entertainment and Cybersecurity.\n\nPlan: https://colincalnan.github.io/allin-2026/
END:VEVENT
