SUMMARY:ALL IN 2026, Day 2
LOCATION:Palais des congrès de Montréal, 1001 Place Jean-Paul-Riopelle, Montréal, QC H2Z 1H5
DESCRIPTION:Day two. Startup Zone and exhibitor floor are the priority over stage time.\n\nPlan: https://colincalnan.github.io/allin-2026/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:allin2026-creative-check@colincalnan.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART:20260916T115500Z
DTEND:20260916T121500Z
SUMMARY:Check app: Creative Industries session time (Agora stage)
LOCATION:Palais des congrès de Montréal, 1001 Place Jean-Paul-Riopelle, Montréal, QC
DESCRIPTION:The exact time was not published in advance. Find it in the event app first thing and put it in the calendar.\n\nCreative Industries, Agora stage. David Lerech (Propulsion Media) and an executive from Runway. Media and Entertainment vertical: journalism, advertising, film, music, design, gaming and digital creation.\n\nThis is the one session not to miss.
