BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:allin2026-mindshift@colincalnan.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART:20260916T210000Z
DTEND:20260917T000000Z
SUMMARY:MINDSHIFT 5@8
LOCATION:Bar Le Mal Nécessaire, 1015 Rue St Alexandre, Montréal, QC H2Z 1N9
DESCRIPTION:Presented by Paperminds and Draft & Goal. Audience is marketing leaders. Framing question: how do we become better with technology, rather than simply better at using it?\n\nRegistration is approval-based via mindshift.social.
