DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART:20260917T213000Z
DTEND:20260918T000000Z
SUMMARY:AI Salon Montréal
LOCATION:Ax.c Le Parquet, 800 Rue du Square-Victoria, 3rd floor, Montréal, QC H3C 0B4
DESCRIPTION:17:30 doors\n17:45 welcome\n18:00 keynote\n18:15 startup demos and pitches\n19:00 networking\n\nHosts: Nicholas Nadeau, Claude G. Théoret, Sylvain Carle. Sponsored by Québec Tech, Affaires mondiales and Ax.c. Founders, builders and investors.\n\nThe 19:00 hour is the reason to go.
