DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART:20260915T130000Z
DTEND:20260915T150000Z
SUMMARY:Deep Dive Into Montréal's AI Ecosystem
LOCATION:Dentons, Montréal, QC
DESCRIPTION:Hosted by Montréal International and Investissement Québec International with Dentons. Free, registration required. Aimed at international delegations; the fastest available map of who is actually in this city.\n\nOptional. End time is an estimate.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:sat-residency-info@colincalnan.github.io
DTSTAMP:20260908T120000Z
DTSTART:20260930T150000Z
DTEND:20260930T160000Z
SUMMARY:SAT Research-Creation Residency, info session (online)
LOCATION:Online, Societe des arts technologiques
DESCRIPTION:Free online information session, 11:00 Montreal time.\n\n$10,000, two months, access to SAT labs and teams. Open to professional artists and collectives worldwide, international included.\n\nOne of three research areas: interactive, real-time generative audiovisual technology using AI, built around Koaia (SAT's real-time Stable Diffusion + TensorRT tool).\n\nContact: residences@sat.qc.ca\nApplication closes 18 October 2026.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT30M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SAT residency info session
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
